		"viz_59meor9j": {
			"cornerRadius": [
				10,
				10,
				10,
				10
			],
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "#fbf4ff",
				"fontColor": "#000000",
				"fontFamily": "Helvetica",
				"markdown": "# Report commitment discount purchases\n`#Allocation`  `#Reporting & Analytics` `#Forecasting`  `#Workload Optimization` `#Architecting for Cloud`  `#Onboarding Workload` `#Anomaly Management` `#Rate Optimization` `#Planning & Estimation`\n### Context\n**Tracking and reconciling** commitment-based discount purchases across providers is a **key to success for FinOps**.\n### FOCUS Columns\n\n- Provider \n- Billing Account ID \n- Commitment Discount ID \n- Commitment Discount Type \n- Charge Frequency \n- Billed Cost \n- Charge Period Start \n- Charge Period End \n- Charge Category \n- Commitment Discount Unit \n- Commitment Discount Quantity"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_6Kyharh8": {
			"cornerRadius": [
				10,
				10,
				10,
				10
			],
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "#fbf4ff",
				"fontColor": "#000000",
				"fontFamily": "Helvetica",
				"markdown": "# Report recurring charges for commitment-based discounts over a period\n`#Allocation`  `#Reporting & Analytics` `#Forecasting`  `#Workload Optimization` `#Architecting for Cloud`  `#Onboarding Workload` `#Anomaly Management` `#Rate Optimization`\n### Context\nAs a Finance person, I want to understand the recurring costs of commitment based discounts over a period of time **to improve forecasting**.\n### FOCUS Columns\n\n- Charge Frequency \n- Billing Period Start \n- Billed Cost \n- Commitment Discount ID \n- Commitment Discount Name"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
		"viz_6uYu5wmf": {
			"dataSources": {
				"primary": "ds_QLm6ljl9"
			},
			"options": {
				"showDonutHole": true,
				"backgroundColor": "#192630"
			},
			"title": "By Service Category",
			"type": "splunk.pie"
		},
