				10,
				10
			],
			"options": {
				"backgroundColor": "#fbf4ff",
				"fontColor": "#000000",
				"fontFamily": "Helvetica",
				"markdown": "# Report effective cost of compute\n`#Allocation`  `#Reporting & Analytics` `#Forecasting`  `#Workload Optimization` `#Architecting for Cloud`  `#Onboarding Workload` `#Anomaly Management` `#Rate Optimization` `#Planning & Estimation`\n### Context\nEngineers and Engineering Managers want to **reduce their billed cost for Compute** from a specific provider. In order to do that, they **need to know the current rate of commitment-based discounts** (without contracted discounts) per type of commitment. This helps to strategize further purchases.\n### FOCUS Columns\n\n- Commitment Discount Type \n- Service Name \n- Provider \n- Sub Account ID \n- Sub Account Name \n- Billing Period Start \n- Effective Cost \n- Service Category \n- Billing Period End"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
		},
