				"fontColor": "#000000",
				"fontFamily": "Helvetica",
				"markdown": "# Determine Effective Savings Rate by Service\n`#Allocation`  `#Reporting & Analytics` `#Forecasting`  `#Workload Optimization` `#Architecting for Cloud`  `#Onboarding Workload` `#Anomaly Management` `#Rate Optimization` `#Planning & Estimation`\n### Context\nThis use cases **focuses on Effective Savings Rate (ESR) per Service**.\n\nThe Effective Savings Rate is a KPI to track the efficiency of using commitment-based discounts. The KPI calculation is (Contracted Cost – Effective Cost) / Contracted Cost)\n\n### FOCUS Columns\n\n- Provider \n- Contracted Unit Price \n- Pricing Quantity \n- Effective Cost \n- Billing Period Start \n- List Cost"
			},
			"type": "splunk.markdown"
