				"markdown": "# Analyze costs of components of a resource\n`#Allocation`  `#Reporting & Analytics` `#Forecasting`  `#Workload Optimization` `#Architecting for Cloud`  `#Onboarding Workload` `#Anomaly Management` `#Rate Optimization` `#Planning & Estimation`\n### Context\nUsing FOCUS data, an Engineer can deep dive on cost details for a single resource.\n### FOCUS Columns\n\n- Resource ID \n- Resource Name \n- Charge Description \n- SKU ID \n- Effective Cost \n- Charge Period Start \n- Charge Period End"
